// Genuine BO1 perk and powerup icons, selected on Nuketown only by the LUI. Art from mjmodz's
// "Black Ops 1 HUD for BO2" v1.0.0 (BO1 images by Kingslayer Kyle) - see Credits in README.md.
// Kept under the pack's own uie_* names with the pack's own materials rather than renamed into
// the old _bo1 scheme, because the art is 128x128 with mipmaps where the retired set was 256x256
// without, and repacking it would have meant transcoding and hand-authoring 18 materials.
//
// This set covers all twelve perks and all six powerups. The old one had no art for Who's Who,
// Electric Cherry, Bonfire Sale or Death Machine, which fell back to stock icons on Nuketown.
